id: bluff-attack
name: Bluff Attack
uaType: both
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Bluff Skill
tpCost: 15
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerBaseTier: 2
requiresTarget: true
# "Make a Clash (Bluff vs Bluff/Intuition)" - the defender choosing - at an Opponent within your Melee Range.
clashSkill: bluff
clashDefenderSkills: bluff, intuition
# Won: Staggered until the end of the turn, Shaken until the end of their next. Lost: their Exploit (chat.mjs
# settleBluffAttack).
bluffs: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Clash of Bluff against their Bluff or Intuition at someone in your Melee Range: won, Staggered for the turn and
  Shaken until the end of their next; lost, their Exploit. Passive: Bluff 1 higher.
text: >
  Bluff Attack: You rear back, charge up a powerful attack, and wait for your opponent to brace for impact- then laugh
  at them for falling for your ruse!
  –Ability Type: Technical/Magical
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Bluff Skill
  –TP Cost: 15
  –KP Cost: 2(bT)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: Increase the Skill Bonus of your Bluff Skill by 1.
  –Effect: Target an Opponent within your Melee Range and make a Clash (Bluff vs Bluff/Intuition) against that
  Opponent. If you win, that Opponent gains the Staggered Combat Condition until the end of the turn and gains the
  Shaken Combat Condition until the end of their next turn.

  If you lose the Clash for the effects of Bluff Attack, you trigger your targeted Opponent’s Exploit Maneuver.

---

# "Increase the Skill Bonus of your Bluff Skill by 1."
[passive]
skill.bluff += 1;
